  "description": "Designed for riders seeking quicker power outburst, lower center of gravity and agility in turns, the Flightline Carbon Pro 27.5 features lightweight Sram X01 drivetrain, Guide RS disc brakes, RockShox Reba RL fork and Ritchey components. There is no lighter and faster 27.5-inch wheel-sized Haro in existence than the FLC Carbon Pro.\nNew FLC frame w/ tapered head tube, BB92 shell, 12mm rear Thru-Axle\nRockShox Reba RL 27.5 Tapered fork, 100mm travel w/ 15m Thru-axle & Onelock remote\nRitchey WCS Logic Zero Drop-In headset\nSram X01 32t crankset w/ PF GXP BB92\nSram X01 rear derailleur\nSram XG 1180 10-42T cassette & X01 Trigger 11-speed shifter\nRitchey WCS Flat handlebar, stem & Lock-On grips\nSram Roam 30 wheelset w/ Thru-Axles, 15mm Frt / 12mm Rear\nKenda Honey Badger XC 27.5*2.05\" 120TPI folding tires\nSram Guide RS 180 / 160mm disc brakes",
